[
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":0,"en":"I HAVE YOU CORNERED."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":1,"en":"Eek... N-No...\nStay away..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":2,"en":"Gugu..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":3,"en":"YOU WILL DO AS I SAY."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":4,"en":"NOW... GIVE UP..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":5,"en":"Eek...\nEEEEEEK!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":6,"en":"Somebody!\nHEEELP!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":7,"en":"Arle!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":8,"en":"Th-Th-This is bad!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":9,"en":"I don't really get what's going on,"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":10,"en":"but Arle's being cornered\nin a really not-good way!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":11,"en":"Nooo!\nArle, run for it!!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":12,"en":"AAAAAAAAH!!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":13,"en":"Amitie, calm down\nfor a sec."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":14,"en":"Arle!\nWe're here to help!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":15,"en":"Ringo! Amitie!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":16,"en":"Waaah!\nI'm saved~...!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":17,"en":"H-Hold on, Arle."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":18,"en":"What did that roundish\nrobot do to you!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":20,"en":"Ugh... He keeps making\nthese terrifying demands."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":21,"en":"*gulp*"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":22,"en":"What kind of demands...?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":23,"en":"He wouldn't leave me alone,\nno matter how much I refused."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":24,"en":"Don't run in the halls!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":25,"en":"Eat your vegetables!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":26,"en":"Wash your hands and gargle!\nDon't forget your hanky!\nAct more ladylike!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":28,"en":"Terrifying... demands...?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":29,"en":"Being tied down like that\nis the WORST thing\nI can imagine!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":30,"en":"Gugugugu!!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":31,"en":"Ah. Sorry about that."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":32,"en":"That's Zed. He's part of\nthe SS Tetra's crew."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":33,"en":"He's a really good guy,\nbut a bit of a nag..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":34,"en":"You're with this\nround guy too!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":35,"en":"Uh... Yeah..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":36,"en":"Then you're gonna say\nterrifying things to me too!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":37,"en":"Um..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":38,"en":"Before that happens,\nyou're gonna battle me!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":40,"en":"Uh, fine by me..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":41,"en":"Go get 'em, Tee!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":42,"en":"It's the classic pattern, after all."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":43,"en":"Right. Leave it to me."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":44,"en":"Alright... here goes!\nWith Puyo Puyo..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":45,"en":"With Tetris..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":6,"idx":46,"en":"Let's battle!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":0,"en":"Ahh, that was fun!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":1,"en":"Gugugu~"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":2,"en":"Feeling better now?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":3,"en":"Yep!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":4,"en":"So the things you clear\naren't Puyo, huh?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":5,"en":"That's right."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":6,"en":"It surprised me too~"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":7,"en":"It appears to be called Tetris."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":8,"en":"Huh~..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":9,"en":"I've seen so many places,\nbut there's still so much\nI don't know."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":10,"en":"The world sure is big!\nRight, Carby?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":11,"en":"Gugugu!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":12,"en":"In any case...\nThat's everyone accounted for."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":13,"en":"Now we just need\na way home..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":14,"en":"If we keep popping Puyo,\nwe'll probably fly home\neventually, right?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":15,"en":"Gugu-gu."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":16,"en":"That's pretty slapdash..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":18,"en":"Tee!\nWh-Wh-What's going on!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":19,"en":"I don't know.\nIt's the SS Tetra's\nemergency alarm!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":20,"en":"Bibibibibibi!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":21,"en":"Something's happening\nin the cockpit..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":22,"en":"Hurry, back to the ship!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":7,"idx":23,"en":"R-Right!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":0,"en":"Wh-Wh-Wha..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":1,"en":"What the heck is THIS!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":2,"en":"Ess!\nWhat happened!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":3,"en":"Can't you see for yourself!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":5,"en":"Sorry. I can't."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":6,"en":"These squishy mystery\nobjects suddenly started\nflooding everywhere..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":7,"en":"and the SS Tetra\nlost control!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":8,"en":"Whoa..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":9,"en":"I've got a very bad feeling\nI've seen this before...\nCHAOS!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":10,"en":"Tee!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":11,"en":"You're the captain!\nDo something!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":12,"en":"Don't ask the impossible!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":13,"en":"Bibibibibi!\nBibibibibi!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":14,"en":"Wh-What did you say!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":15,"en":"At this rate, the Tetra\nwill be caught by that\nblue planet's gravity..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":16,"en":"...and crash!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":18,"en":"GYAAAAAH!!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":19,"en":"A-Anyway, we have\nto clear these Puyo!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":20,"en":"Gugugu!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":21,"en":"Yeah! Let's all\ndo our best!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":22,"en":"Ringo!\nI'll help too."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":23,"en":"Teach me how to clear\nthese \"Puyo\" things."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":24,"en":"Okay!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":25,"en":"But in return...\nIf we all make it out okay..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":26,"en":"I'm going to have Tee...\nteach me how to clear\nTetriminos..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":27,"en":"...Ringo."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":28,"en":"I feel like a flag that\nshould never be raised\nwas just raised..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":29,"en":"Puyo pop when you\nline up four\nof the same color."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":30,"en":"There's chains and garbage\nand all sorts of technique\nstuff, but..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":31,"en":"I'm sure you'll figure\nit out on the fly!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":32,"en":"Huh!? Um..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":33,"en":"Alright, here we go!\nLet's..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":8,"idx":34,"en":"Puyo battle!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":1,"en":"Alright! We can't\nlose either, right Carby?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":2,"en":"Gugugu!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":3,"en":"Pipipipipi!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":4,"en":"Huh? You're Tee's\npartner... O, right?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":5,"en":"Pipi-pi!\nPipipi-pi!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":6,"en":"You and Tee..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":7,"en":"You're kinda like\nme and Carby."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":8,"en":"Gugugu!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":9,"en":"Pipipi!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":10,"en":"You'll help me\npop Puyo?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":11,"en":"Pipi!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":12,"en":"Got it!\nThen... here goes!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":10,"idx":13,"en":"Puyo Puyo battle!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":0,"en":"*pant* *pant*"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":1,"en":"*huff* *huff*"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":2,"en":"W-We've cleared\nquite a lot."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":3,"en":"Everyone worked\nso hard~"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":4,"en":"Yeah. At this rate..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":5,"en":"WHAAAT!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":6,"en":"I-It's no good! They just\nkeep coming, more and\nmore and more!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":7,"en":"Gugugugu!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":8,"en":"O! How much longer\ncan the Tetra hold out!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":9,"en":"Bibibibi..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":10,"en":"Tee!\nWhat did O just say!?"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":11,"en":"...Um."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":12,"en":"Reporting..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":13,"en":"The spaceship SS Tetra\nhas completely\nlost control,"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":14,"en":"and will crash-land\non that blue planet."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":16,"en":"Wha... Huh... Oh..."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/chapter00Japanese.mtx","sec":11,"idx":17,"en":"WHOOOOOOOAAA!!!!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/adv_popupJapanese.mtx","sec":0,"idx":0,"en":"Chapter 2 is now available!\nUse the L/R Buttons\nto change chapters."},
{"file":"tenp/text/adventure/adv_popupJapanese.mtx","sec":0,"idx":1,"en":"Congratulations!\nCollect the stars to\nfill in every one!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/menu/mainmenusJapanese.mtx","sec":0,"idx":0,"en":"Opens a new room.\nAnyone who wants to play\nshould join this room.\nYou can join using just a\nNintendo 3DS system, even\nwithout a Game Card."},
{"file":"tenp/text/Replay/replaypopJapanese.mtx","sec":0,"idx":20,"en":"Waiting for the other\nplayers to decide..."},
