{"file":"tenp/text/network/network_MatchingclubJapanese.mtx","sec":0,"idx":11,"en":"In VS, choose Puyo Puyo\nor Tetris, whichever\nyou're best at!"},
{"file":"tenp/text/network/network_F1Japanese.mtx","sec":0,"idx":4,"en":"Matchmaking with\nParty rules..."}
]
